# GPU outputs (run folders, checkpoints, logs, audio) are large: keep them out of git.
# At home they live outside the repo, in $GPU_OUTPUTS_DIR (see device.outputs_dir and SETUP_GPU.md);
# on the GPU machine (variable unset) they land here, still ignored.
# Env reports (env_report_*.json) are small and always written here by check_env.py: they stay tracked.
outputs/*
!outputs/env_report_*.json
